Modified: 2026-09-25, Kari Vierimaa, Kempele, Finland.
Description: Translated from VHDL to SystemVerilog.

This directory is a modification of Covered Source from the CERN colibri
library, made under section 3 of CERN-OHL-W-2.0. The modification is a
translation from VHDL to SystemVerilog. Module names, generic names, port
names, and behaviour are kept where the language allows.

